655\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350810/extras/b83714469401335f21295a9adce7c755.avif?t=1680660655\" /></span><br><br>- Add magic weapon and spear weapons<br>- Add chainsaw<br>- Add various passive skill items<br>- Add stage<br>- More room types<br>- Special upgrade tech for each weapon<br>- Add gambling object<br>- Story progression for each character<br>- Game balance adjustments<br>- Add and spawn active skills",
